questions.analysis:
（a）设 $\eta'$ 静止参考系为 $S'$，实验室参考系为 $S$。

对光子由能量和动量的洛伦兹变换

$$
\begin{cases}
p' \cos \theta' = \gamma (p \cos \theta - \beta E) \\
E' = \gamma (E - \beta p \cos \theta)
\end{cases}
\tag{4'}
$$

$$
\cos \theta' = \frac{\cos \theta - \beta}{1 - \beta \cos \theta}
\tag{2'}
$$

$$
\frac{d\cos\theta'}{d\cos\theta}=\frac{1-\beta^{2}}{\left(1-\beta\cos\theta\right)^{2}}
\tag{2'}
$$

而在 $S'$ 系中的概率分布

$$
dA = \frac{2\pi d(\cos\theta')}{4\pi}
\tag{2'}
$$

变换到实验室系 $dA = A(\theta) d\cos \theta$

$$
A(\theta) = \frac{1 - \beta^{2}}{2(1 - \beta\cos\theta)^{2}}
\tag{2'}
$$

（b）在 $S'$ 系中能量和动量守恒

$$
\begin{cases}
Mc^{2} = \sqrt{m^{2}c^{4} + p_{\rho^{0}}^{2}c^{2}} + E' \\
p = p_{\rho^{0}}
\end{cases}
\tag{4'}
$$

解得

$$
E' = \frac{M^{2} - m^{2}}{2M}c^{2}
\tag{2'}
$$

$$
E' = \gamma E(\theta)(1 - \beta \cos \theta)
\tag{2'}
$$

$$
E(\theta) = \frac{M^{2}-m^{2}}{2\gamma M(1-\beta\cos\theta)}c^{2}
\tag{2'}
$$

（c）设初始粒子线密度为 $\lambda_0$，则

$$
\lambda_0 = \frac{j}{v}
\tag{2'}
$$

半衰期变为 $T\gamma$

$$
\lambda = \frac{j e^{-\frac{x \ln 2}{v T \gamma}}}{v}
\tag{6'}
$$

对于从粒子流的 $x$ 处射到屏幕 $r$ 处的粒子

$$
\cos \theta = \frac{L - x}{\sqrt{(L - x)^2 + r^2}}
\tag{2'}
$$

$$
\frac{dn}{dtds} = \int_{0}^{L} -\frac{d\lambda}{dx} \frac{dx}{dt} dx A(\theta) \frac{d\cos\theta}{2\pi dr}
\tag{2'}
$$

而有几何关系

$$
dr \cos \theta = \frac{r d \theta}{\sin \theta}
\tag{2'}
$$

$$
\frac{d n}{d t d s}=\int_{0}^{L} \frac{\ln 2 j e^{-\frac{x \ln 2}{v T \gamma}}}{v T \gamma} \frac{1-\beta^{2}}{2\left(1-\beta \frac{L-x}{\sqrt{\left(L-x\right)^{2}+r^{2}}}\right)^{2}} \frac{L-x}{2 \pi\left(\sqrt{\left(L-x\right)^{2}+r^{2}}\right)^{3}} d x
\tag{4'}
$$
